  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using pca_n2000 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders (e.g., config_015) achieve the highest accuracy. This experiment tests a similar setup with scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoder to compare RNA encoder choices while maintaining avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion. It clarifies whether switching RNA encoders impacts performance, balancing exploration of RNA encoder alternatives with the known strength of imagenet_vit_l for images."
